### Start session
POST http://localhost:8080/api/atm/ATM_A1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "4111111111111111",
  "pin": "1234"
}

### Check balance
POST http://localhost:8080/api/atm/sessions/{{sessionId}}/balance

### Withdraw cash
POST http://localhost:8080/api/atm/sessions/{{sessionId}}/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100.00
}

### Deposit cash
POST http://localhost:8080/api/atm/sessions/{{sessionId}}/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 50.00
}

### End session
POST http://localhost:8080/api/atm/sessions/{{sessionId}}/end
